OL,3,GNEWSADad hits out as scammer Scouts
OL,4,Aboss avoids jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision to spare a senior Scout boss
OL,7,Fjail, despite him admitting
OL,8,Fresponsibility for a #200,000 fraud
OL,9,Fscam, has angered a parent of one of
OL,10,Fthe scouts, who has called the
OL,11,Fjudgement "disappointing".
OL,13,FRobert Sidley, of Henry Street,
OL,14,FWorcester, pleaded guilty to fraud at
OL,15,FWorcester Crown Court on Monday, where
OL,16,Fhe received a 32 month prison sentence,
OL,17,Fsuspended for two years. He was also
OL,18,Finstructed to complete 220 hours unpaid
OL,19,Fwork.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
