OL,3,GNEWSADad hits out as scammer Scouts
OL,4,Aboss avoids jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FSimon Carter, from Worcester, said the
OL,7,F46-year-old's crime had stolen a "once
OL,8,Fin a lifetime experience".
OL,10,FCarter's son was one of 100 children
OL,11,Fwho had been looking forward to a
OL,12,Ftwo-week trip to Canada, after more
OL,13,Fthan a year of fundraising.
